# AN ALLOW MARKER WITH NO REASON IS ITSELF A FINDING, and the line under it is still reported.
#
# If a bare mute worked, it would be pasted without reading — which is how an exemption mechanism
# stops being a decision and becomes a reflex. The estate has a precedent for the number: the
# scope-exemption file `service-ci.yml` reads applies the same forty-character floor to the same
# kind of judgement.

# secret-hygiene: allow
MUTED_PASSWORD=${MUTED_PASSWORD:-a-literal-hidden-behind-a-mute}

# secret-hygiene: allow legacy
SHORT_REASON_TOKEN=${SHORT_REASON_TOKEN:-another-literal-behind-a-mute}
